@base = http://localhost:5080
@org = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@workOrder = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### CSRF
GET {{base}}/api/auth/csrf

### Login
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{
  "email": "admin.northwind@opsflow.example",
  "password": "set-from-local-configuration"
}

### Current user
GET {{base}}/api/auth/me

### Work orders
GET {{base}}/api/organizations/{{org}}/work-orders?page=1&pageSize=25&sort=createdAt&direction=desc&status=Open

### Create
POST {{base}}/api/organizations/{{org}}/work-orders
Content-Type: application/json
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-create-0001

{
  "title": "Lobby HVAC is warm",
  "description": "East lobby unit is not cooling.",
  "category": "HVAC",
  "priority": "High"
}

### Claim
POST {{base}}/api/organizations/{{org}}/work-orders/{{workOrder}}/claim
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-claim-0001

### Report
GET {{base}}/api/organizations/{{org}}/reports/summary?from=2026-01-01T00:00:00Z&to=2026-12-31T00:00:00Z
